- **type / predicate** — schema-attribute metadata, sub-property hierarchy, audit invariants
- **actor sub-tree** — model name, provider, capabilities, version
- **rule / engine / event** — LHS pattern, RHS action, firing context, engine binding
- **meta-type sub-tree** — meta-meta type composition

